		{"name":"printfigures","doc":"\\printfigures causes the figures and plates to be output at the end of the manuscript and cameraready copy; this is in addition to the figure captions that are always output and is only meaningful if the figure and plate environments really contain something to print."},
		{"name":"sectionnumbers","doc":"\\sectionnumbers turns on section numbering; default is no numbering, as preferred by AGU; must be given before the first \\section command."},
